  historySlides:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b73bc08c4b38deb4fb9a493f46182a8e, type: 3}
    subtitle: "N\u0103m 1954 \u2014 Sau Hi\u1EC7p \u0111\u1ECBnh Gen\xE8ve, v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t \u0110\u1ECF C\xE0 Mau tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh \u0111i\u1EC3m t\u1EADp k\u1EBFt 200 ng\xE0y l\u1ECBch s\u1EED."
    displayDuration: 5
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0719188e6b227c3458491679901ff487, type: 3}
    subtitle: "H\xE0ng v\u1EA1n \u0111\u1ED3ng b\xE0o, chi\u1EBFn s\u0129 v\xE0 nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi con mi\u1EC1n Nam t\u1EC1 t\u1EF1u b\xEAn \u0111\xF4i b\u1EDD s\xF4ng \u0110\u1ED1c chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB cho chuy\u1EBFn \u0111i xa."
    displayDuration: 5
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6bcf1bc5577c38641a6cb82b98bdedeb, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Nh\u1EEFng \xE1nh m\u1EAFt l\u01B0u luy\u1EBFn, nh\u1EEFng c\xE1i \xF4m si\u1EBFt ch\u1EB7t v\xE0 l\u1EDDi th\u1EC1 son s\u1EAFt h\u1EB9n ng\xE0y non s\xF4ng th\u1ED1ng nh\u1EA5t."
    displayDuration: 5
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cc1f3247da81ae045879b0a85db8682b, type: 3}
    subtitle: "Chuy\u1EBFn t\xE0u chuy\u1EC3n qu\xE2n r\u1EDDi b\u1EBFn trong n\u1EAFng chi\u1EC1u, mang theo h\xE0nh trang c\u1EE7a c\u1EA3 m\u1ED9t th\u1EBF h\u1EC7 ki\xEAn trung."
    displayDuration: 5.5
